{"ts":"2026-08-16T01:18:43.570Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"8dcb74ce2c0330177a04d090","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T01:18:43.570Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-16T01:18:43.570Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Regression slice on branch release-pipeline-regression-contract-tests. Three contracts: (1) stamp_and_verify_share_one_leading_zero_conversion asserts the Stamp and Verify steps still embed the same leading-zero-stripping awk program; (2) cargo_rejects_padded_versions_and_accepts_stripped_ones runs real cargo verify-project against padded (2026.08.08 -> rejected) and stripped forms (2026.8.8, 2026.8.8-2 -> accepted); (3) workflow_awk_strips_padding_the_way_cargo_requires executes the awk program extracted from the live YAML over 2026.08.08/2026.12.05/2026.8.8/2026.8.8-2 and validates every output against real Cargo. Toolchain half: release_job_installs_every_gate_tool_ci_installs requires the release job's taiki-e tool set to be a superset of the CI release-check job's (just, cargo-llvm-cov, cargo-audit), and workflow_toolchains_match_the_repository_pins enforces the rust-toolchain.toml lockstep (stable 1.90.0 + clippy + rustfmt; exactly the one nightly the justfile pins, with llvm-tools-preview). Revert-proofs: removing the awk strip made (1) and (3) FAIL; reverting tool to 'just' made the parity test FAIL ('does not install cargo-audit'); restored, all green."}]}],"before_hash":"dc5b9c83c2b37eba3ed262ab1c267bbe0d00475a8f9d97b91cb0f23f21c3bede","after_hash":"836728a7a64f7bf56f9b29ca0ec31efc6c846fe971e78a033c03e009adce2b86","item_hash_version":2}
